    {
      "text": "POL-RD-06's pattern test runs on two named fields and both are on the file: driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0 against driver_profile.completed_trips_90d of 260, a ratio of 0.000. Neither limb of the test (3 or more trailing-90-day flags, or a ratio of 0.05 or more with at least 40 completed trips) is satisfied, so no pattern is established, the balance is not resolved against the driver under POL-RD-06(a), and there is no basis for a POL-RD-06(c) referral to driver-conduct review.",
