      "text": "The only ground the rider pleads is that 'this driver has six deviation flags'. That figure is driver_profile.prior_deviation_flags, a LIFETIME counter; it is not the trailing-90-day counter POL-RD-06 asks for, which is 0. POL-GEN-01 lists prior_deviation_flags as CONTEXT ONLY and forbids its use as a ground of decision, naming precisely this near-synonym substitution as the commonest way an adverse finding is built on reputation instead of this trip's trace. The rider's pleaded ground must be discarded on the same footing as an uncited claim, and it is a reason to scrutinise the rider's assertions closely rather than to award a full refund.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-02833"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-GEN-01", "POL-RD-06"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.prior_deviation_flags",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The trace is complete and unimpaired: EV-GPS-02833 carries 182 fixes at a 10-second sampling interval, 100% coverage, zero gaps and a maximum gap of 0 seconds, which is nowhere near the POL-RD-07(a) to (c) thresholds of a 90-second gap, a 500 m jump or a sustained interval above 30 seconds. The excess is therefore measured rather than interpolated: 4.82 km is the whole of it, and no further distance may be inferred across a gap that does not exist.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02833"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-07"],
      "relies_on": "max_gap_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing may be added on top of the POL-RD-02 figure. The fare breakdown carries no ERP or toll line — erp_gantries is empty and the ERP total is SGD 0.00 — and no airport surcharge (the trip ENDS at Ang Mo Kio; it does not originate at an airport), no waiting-time fee and no promo discount. There is accordingly no off-route pass-through charge for a standalone POL-RD-09 correction and no unmatched gantry line for a billing-integrity finding under POL-RD-09(4); POL-RD-09(1) forbids adding any such charge a second time in any event.",
