      "text": "The bundle holds no traffic advisory for this trip: EV-ADVIS-02833-01 is MISSING, its issue code is MISSING_ARTIFACT and its weight_multiplier is 0.0, so POL-RD-03 cannot be run and the driver's one-word 'Traffic.' statement supplies neither an exoneration nor an amended optimal — the computation must run against the booked optimal of 18.4 km and 24.8 minutes. The same absence does not escalate the case either: under POL-RD-13 an assertion that cites no advisory identifier cannot be invoked against one, so no POL-RD-10(5) trigger fires and the matter is decided on the trace as measured.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-02833-01", "EV-TRIP-02833"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-13", "POL-RD-03", "POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.advisory_area.advisories",
      "asserted_weight": 0.0
    }
  ]
