the issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT and has weight_multiplier 0.0; its absence is citable but it can carry no fact. POL-RD-03 therefore cannot be run, and under POL-RD-13 the traffic assertion carries no weight under POL-RD-08: it neither reduces the measured excess nor supplies an amended optimal route, so the computation runs against the booked optimal of 18.4 km and 24.8 minutes. For the same reason the missing advisory is not an escalation trigger under POL-RD-10(5): the party asserting the traffic cause named no evidence identifier for an advisory, so no exculpatory clause was invoked against a cited artifact. No other POL-RD-10 trigger is present — trip identifiers match, the trace is unimpaired, no timestamps conflict, and the refund is well under SGD 150.00 and under the charged total. The case is decided with money moving.\n\nTHE REFUND (POL-RD-02). The fare model on EV-FARE-02833 is METERED, so POL-RD-11 does not apply and the refund is arithmetic. Charged total: SGD 30.46. Recomputed fare: (3.80 base + 0.75 x 18.4 km = 13.80 distance + 0.28 x 24.8 min = 6.944 time) x 1.0 surge, the multiplier read from fare_breakdown.surge_multiplier and not assumed = 24.5440, plus 0.80 platform fee, plus 0.00 ERP/tolls on the optimal route, plus 0.00 waiting-time fee, less 0.00 promo discount = SGD 25.3440. Refund = 30.46 - 25.3440 = SGD 5.1160, rounded UP to the nearest SGD 0.05 = SGD 5.15. That is above the SGD 0.50 de minimis floor, so the outcome is not NO_ACTION, and it is 16.8% of the charged total, far short of the 90% that would make it a FULL_REFUND instead of a partial. The rider sought SGD 7.50 and is awarded SGD 5.15.\n\nPASS-THROUGH LINES. EV-FARE-02833 shows ERP and tolls of SGD 0.00 with an empty erp_gantries list, no airport surcharge (this trip ends at Ang Mo Kio; it does not originate at an airport), a waiting-time fee of 0.00 and no promo discount. There is accordingly nothing to add on top of the POL-RD-02 figure and nothing to refund as a standalone POL-RD-09 correction; no charge line lacks a counterpart in the trace or trip record, so there is no billing-integrity finding and no referral on that ground either.\n\nThe monetary effect, SGD 5.15, does not exceed the SGD 8.00 automatic-execution threshold, so this provisional ruling is executed on issue, subject to the appeal route in POL-GEN-04. This ruling rests on artifacts at full weight (EV-GPS-02833, EV-TRIP-02833 and EV-FARE-02833, each weight_multiplier 1.0); the only impaired artifact, EV-ADVIS-02833-01 at weight 0.0 for MISSING_ARTIFACT, carries no fact the ruling relies on."
